# Automated Static Website Deployment via Jenkins Pipeline & SSH Agent

## Overview
Configured an automated Continuous Deployment (CD) pipeline in **Jenkins** for xFusionCorp Industries to deploy updates from a **Gitea** repository (`sarah/web_app`) directly to the Apache document root (`/var/www/html`) on Nautilus Application Server 1 (`stapp01`), fronted by the Nautilus Load Balancer (`stlb01`).

---

## Architecture & Workflow

+-------------------+        +-----------------------+        +----------------------------+        +------------------+
|  Gitea Repository |        |    Jenkins Master     |        |  Jenkins SSH Agent         |        |  Load Balancer   |
|  (sarah/web_app)  | <----- |  (devops-webapp-job)  | => |  App Server 1 (stapp01)    | <= |  (stlb01:80)     |
|  http://gitea:3000|  pull  |  Stage: Deploy        |  SSH   |  Root: /home/sarah/        |  HTTP  |  Main Root URL   |
+-------------------+        +-----------------------+        |        jenkins_agent       |        +------------------+
|  DocRoot: /var/www/html    |
+----------------------------+


### Infrastructure Specifications
| Role | Hostname | Service / Port | Working Directory |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Jenkins Controller** | `jenkins` | Jenkins UI (`8080`) | `/var/lib/jenkins` |
| **Build Agent / App Server** | `stapp01` (`App Server 1`) | SSH (`22`), Apache (`8080`) | Agent: `/home/sarah/jenkins_agent`<br>Web Root: `/var/www/html` |
| **Source Control** | `gitea` | Gitea (`3000`) | `http://gitea:3000/sarah/web_app.git` |
| **Load Balancer** | `stlb01` | Nginx HTTP (`80`/`443`) | Routes root `/` traffic to `stapp01:8080` |

