## Implementation Steps

### 1. Target Node Preparation (`stapp01`)
Prepared `App Server 1` (`stapp01`) to support the Jenkins remoting agent and non-interactive Git operations as user `sarah`:
* **Runtime Upgrade:** Installed OpenJDK 17 (`java-17-openjdk`) to match the Jenkins Controller Java classfile version (`61.0`).
* **Directory & Ownership Isolation:** Created `/home/sarah/jenkins_agent` as the isolated agent root directory and assigned ownership of both `/home/sarah/jenkins_agent` and `/var/www/html` to `sarah:sarah`.
* **Git Configuration:** Configured `safe.directory` for `/var/www/html` and stored Gitea credentials via `credential.helper store` so pipeline builds execute `git pull` non-interactively.

```bash
sudo yum install -y java-17-openjdk
sudo mkdir -p /home/sarah/jenkins_agent
sudo chown -R sarah:sarah /home/sarah/jenkins_agent /var/www/html
sudo -u sarah git config --global --add safe.directory /var/www/html
sudo -u sarah git config --global credential.helper store
echo "http://sarah:Sarah_pass123@gitea:3000" | sudo tee /home/sarah/.git-credentials >/dev/null
sudo chown sarah:sarah /home/sarah/.git-credentials
2. Jenkins Plugin & SSH Agent Provisioning
Configured the Jenkins Controller via jenkins-cli.jar:

Installed SSH Build Agents (ssh-slaves) and Pipeline (workflow-aggregator) plugins and restarted Jenkins.

Created global username/password credential sarah-ssh-cred for sarah.

Registered permanent agent App Server 1 with label stapp01, remote root directory /home/sarah/jenkins_agent, and NonVerifyingKeyVerificationStrategy.

3. Declarative Pipeline Configuration (devops-webapp-job)
Created a standard Pipeline job named devops-webapp-job targeting label stapp01 with a single Deploy stage:

Groovy
pipeline {
    agent {
        label 'stapp01'
    }
    stages {
        stage('Deploy') {
            steps {
                sh '''
                    cd /var/www/html
                    git pull origin master || git pull origin main
                '''
            }
        }
    }
}
Troubleshooting & Root Cause Resolution
Issue Encountered	Root Cause	Resolution
UnsupportedClassVersionError (class file version 61.0 vs 55.0) on jumphost and stapp01	Default Java runtime on jumphost and stapp01 was OpenJDK 11 (55.0), whereas Jenkins CLI and remoting.jar require Java 17 (61.0).	Executed jenkins-cli.jar directly from the jenkins controller (Java 17) and installed java-17-openjdk on stapp01.
fatal: detected dubious ownership in repository at '/var/www/html'	Repository was initially cloned by root before ownership was transferred to sarah.	Registered /var/www/html in sarah's global Git safe.directory configuration.
